### lys-shell Configuration - Minimized Windows Module

## Minimized Windows Module Configuration

settings-modules-minimized-windows-icon = Icon for Apps Without an Icon
    .description = Shown for a window whose app has no icon of its own, and as the module's icon while nothing is minimized and Keep in Bar When Empty is on

settings-modules-minimized-windows-icon-size = Icon Size
    .description = Size of each window's icon

settings-modules-minimized-windows-show-when-empty = Keep in Bar When Empty
    .description = Show the module's icon in the bar while nothing is minimized

settings-modules-minimized-windows-scope = Show Windows From
    .description = The minimized windows of the display the bar is on, or of every display

## WindowScope variants
enum-window-scope-output = This Display
enum-window-scope-all = All Displays
